  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidrag till IDEA f&#xf6;r lokalkostnader och skatter 2023</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to IDEA for costs for premises and taxes 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">According to the Host Country Agreement between International IDEA and Sweden, the Swedish Government will annually reimburse International IDEA for the office rent and for tax payable by officials of the organisation who are not exempted from tax in Sweden. 
The Government Offices of Sweden (Swedish Ministry for Foreign Affairs) has granted a contribution amounting to 8 331 344 SEK to International IDEA to cover the cost of renting office space during the period of 1 January 20233 &#x2013; 31 December 2023 and a contribution amounting to 13 133 889 Swedish kronor to International IDEA for tax payable by officials of the organization who are not exempted from tax during the same period.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidrag till IDEA f&#xf6;r lokalkostnader och skatter 2023</narrative>
  </description>
